  `fig3-cmp`); the later headers renumber by position `## Figure 3/4/5` →
  `## Figure 4/5/6` (markdown `82535ad9`/`f0872be1`/`md-fig6`; cell order and the
  commented state of Figs 4/5/6 unchanged). **Notebook is now 15 cells / 6
  figures** (Figs 4/5/6 still the commented ones).
- **What it shows.** Same 2×3 grid as Fig 2 (columns = models, top row =
  unweighted/standard model, bottom = survey-weighted), but each metric now has
  **grouped horizontal bars: GREY = unweighted test − unweighted population,
  ACCENT = weighted test − unweighted population** (`h=0.38`, offset `(0.5−s)·h`).
  Rebuilds `pop_df` (same `population_unweighted_*` query as Fig 2) and merges the
