  20-iteration parquets; `gen_df` = 30 rows (3 models × 2 variants × 5 metrics),
  standard-row gaps +0.000–+0.004, survey-weighted-row gaps −0.000–+0.002.
  Rendered to PNG and eyeballed (2×3, grey top / blue bottom, single bars, row
