### 2026-08-11 — `create_figures.ipynb`: re-add calibration as Fig 7
- **User directive:** add the calibration figure too. **Note this reverses the
  2026-08-07 "calibration removed" directive** — the `predicted_proba_*`
  columns were kept in the labeled parquets, so nothing had to be re-run.
