  the unused `TEST_PARQUET` constant and the `raw_df` intermediate (inlined the
  `pd.DataFrame(rows).groupby(...)`); folded the labeled-parquet load into one
  comprehension. Behavior unchanged — same `metrics_df`, `rate_df`, `labeled`,
